The '''Divizia B 1994–95 season''' was the 55th season of [[Divizia B]], the second tier of the [[Romanian football league system]].

The winner of each series of the [[Divizia B]] was promoted to the [[Divizia A 1995–96|Divizia A]], and the runner up from each series played a playoff. The bottom two teams were relegated to the [[Divizia C]], who were also joined by the 15th and 16th placed teams which lost the playoffs.

