'''Ethnikos Asteras F.C.''' ({{lang-el|Εθνικός Aστέρας}}) is a professional [[association football|football]] club based in [[Kaisariani]], [[Athens]], [[Greece]], currently competing in [[Beta Ethniki]], the Greek [[Second Division|second division]].

The club, originally named ''Ethnikos Astir,'' was founded in 1927 from the merger of Ethnikos and Asteras Kaisariani.  They participated in the [[Super League Greece|Greek first division]] from 1998 until 2002. 

The club's colors are red and white.

